	"_fx_note": "International gov_fee_by_class[n] = WIPO per-country designation fee for n classes (CHF->AUD at fx_chf_to_aud, rounded $5). EXCLUDES the once-per-application WIPO base fee, which is held separately in wipo_base. Australia is a TTMF special case (is_australia:true) with its own gov + service schedules and does NOT use wipo_base or the shared service tier.",
